  },
  {
   "i": 1093,
   "src": "84c36b444e11",
   "t": "A contest would be good motivation."
  },
  {
   "i": 1096,
   "src": "0dbee0ffdbee",
   "t": "Plus, it'd repay our tournament debt--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1104,
   "src": "0814cada342d",
   "t": "right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "37fe09f4a07d",
