   "t": "{{medabot|pl}} are wiped out of this area."
  },
  {
   "i": 1251,
   "src": "181ed27c5e52",
   "t": "We'll decide the winner by who hunts"
  },
  {
   "i": 1254,
   "src": "e92a53c26b90",
   "t": "more Medabots within that period."
  },
  {
   "i": 1262,
   "src": "51e560d5c0f3",
   "t": "Our {{homura}} will keep count."
  },
  {
   "i": 1265,
   "src": "ef2714089a1f",
   "t": "She's very serious; no cheating at all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1273,
   "src": "a5bdd9d04cd9",
   "t": "If you still doubt it, the {{exploration_club}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1276,
